"content":"Keratin"},{"identifier":"B","content":"Albumin"},{"identifier":"C","content":"Collagen"},{"identifier":"D","content":"Myosin"}],"correct_options":["B"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>Fibrous proteins are characterized by their elongated, insoluble structure and often serve structural or mechanical roles. Among the options provided, keratin, collagen, and myosin are examples of fibrous proteins.</p>\n<p>Albumin, on the other hand, is a globular protein that is soluble in water. It has a more spherical shape compared to the elongated shape of fibrous proteins. Albumin is found in blood plasma and has various functions including maintaining osmotic pressure.</p>\n<p>So, the correct answer is:</p>\n<p>Option B: Albumin.</p>\n"},"hi":{"direction":null,"content":"निम्नलिखित में से कौन रेशेदार प्रोटीन का उदाहरण नहीं है?","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"केरातिन"},{"identifier":"B","content":"एल्बुमिन"},{"identifier":"C","content":"कोलेजन"},{"identifier":"D","content":"मायोसिन"}],"correct_options":["B"],"answer":null,"explanation":null,"comprehension":null}},"subject":"chemistry","subjectGroup":null,"timeAllotted":120000,"topic":"proteins-and-enzymes","type":"mcq","year":2021,"paperId":"jee-main-2021-online-31st-august-evening-shift","isOutOfSyllabus":false,"isBonus":false,"tags":["odd_one_out"],"yearKey":"jee-main-2021-online-31st-august-evening-shift","active":true},{"question_id":"1ktjviluh","chapter":"aldehydes-ketones-and-carboxylic-acids","chapterGroup":"organic-chemistry","country":"in","difficulty":"medium","exam":"jee-main","examGroup":"jee","languages":["en"],"marks":4,"negMarks":1,"paperTitle":"JEE Main 2021 (Online) 31st August Evening Shift","permalink":"for-the-reaction-given-below--brbrimagebrbrthe-jee-main-chemistry-some-basic-concepts-of-chemistry-7iutz9git2mjthpv","question":{"en":{"direction":null,"content":"For the reaction given below :-<br><br><img src=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/1kumonm6y/61dae54c-b150-4e65-adf3-99f480e54fe2/f